    "updated_at": "2022-03-23T06:44:20Z",
    "body": "For me, it's caused by the below hook copied from https://github.com/akermu/emacs-libvterm/blob/a940dd2ee8a82684860e320c0f6d5e15d31d916f/README.md#vterm-buffer-name-string\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nautoload -U add-zsh-hook\r\nadd-zsh-hook -Uz chpwd (){ print -Pn \"\\e]2;%m:%2~\\a\" }\r\n```",
