    "body": "For me, it's [zoxide](https://github.com/ajeetdsouza/zoxide) that interferes with the status_code reporting.\r\n\r\n`echo $?` reports the correct value, but the symbol always shows success.\r\n\r\nMaybe someone knows how to make them coexist without interference ? ",
